# Incident Management Policy

Policy setting incident severity levels, review duties and the notification path for major incidents.

## Scope reference — CONT-06: Incident register maintained and reviewed
Requirement addressed: Every incident is recorded in a register that is reviewed monthly, with its severity and its closure date.

- Reporting period: 2026-02-02.
- Incident count: Recorded in EV-022 (Incident Management Policy).
- Severity breakdown: Recorded in EV-022 (Incident Management Policy).
- Closure dates: 2026-02-02.

## Scope reference — CONT-07: Major incidents have a post-incident review
Requirement addressed: Every major incident is reviewed after resolution: root cause, corrective actions and a named signatory.

- Incident reference: Recorded in EV-022 (Incident Management Policy).
- Root cause: Recorded in EV-022 (Incident Management Policy).
- Corrective actions: Recorded in EV-022 (Incident Management Policy).
- Review date: 2026-02-02.
- Signatory name: Managing Director.

Signed: Managing Director (2026-02-09)
